From 466b3fe6f28d29f0ea97962e029bea0fef4bb4a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jackie Han <jackie.han@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 21:41:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] luci-app-passwall2: show the node a balancer currently uses

Expose a loopback-only xray API (RoutingService) on the main node, add a
balancer_status controller endpoint that asks it which node each balancer
currently picks, and show the result under the Node field on the Main
page.
---
